{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:03 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:03 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:03 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"上海街 / 示意圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab4d3960506719afc3150b71a01e4b96/2026-11/2026-11-19_23_53_25.png\"/><p>油麻地發生猝死事件。今日（20日）凌晨1時許，一名47歲男子在上海街251號對開街頭突然暈倒，同行朋友見狀報案。救護員接報趕抵現場，證實事主當場死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>據了解，男事主為尼泊爾裔，持有香港身分證，事發前曾感到身體不適。警方正跟進事件，確實死因有待法醫驗屍後進一步確認。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:09.634802+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:03:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:40.088199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:28.379401+00:00","content_hash":"19c8d58846d097b8fae0cee9985cfd4e32cb645e00b2089ddc8ac31f18dd77aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}